Homepage: https://github.com/va3mw/FlexRadio-Broadcast-Wedge
Description: Relay FlexRadio discovery broadcasts across a VPN
 Makes FlexRadios on one subnet appear in the SmartSDR radio chooser on
 another, so SmartSDR can connect to them directly over a VPN or routed link.
 .
 Runs as a service and is configured from a web page on port 4997.
 Not a FlexRadio product; provided with no warranty.
